        {
          "book": "MAT",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! For you travel around by sea and land to make one proselyte; and when he becomes one, you make him twice as much a son of Gehennaas yourselves.",
      "ko": "화 있을찐저 외식하는 서기관들과 바리새인들이여 너희는 교인 하나를 얻기 위하여 바다와 육지를 두루 다니다가 생기면 너희보다 배나 더 지옥 자식이 되게 하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "dc14c77a3fcd29bb497f3dcb7802b9381b820670bbbef65ad444f881fe4d4523",
      "translation_text_hash": "d7c503c68f2ec088f6bd2b09907a7de9500bb00e6011cf49bd728aa0ff8cc3f1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
