      "en": "and say, ‘If we had lived in the days of our fathers, we wouldn’t have been partakers with them in the blood of the prophets.’",
      "ko": "만일 우리가 조상 때에 있었더면 우리는 저희가 선지자의 피를 흘리는데 참예하지 아니하였으리라 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "5d60b64fc10ba6065424f06cf3d8a9ffa4d90f3b1ea8a2dcb581c551d23d58a0",
